# React Native Non-Negotiables

- Use Expo with TypeScript for faster development
- Use React Navigation for screen navigation (native-stack)
- Follow the same UI/UX as the KYCISDemo Android app
- Use functional components with hooks
- Keep responses concise
- Test builds after code changes

# Tech Stack

- Expo SDK 53 (latest stable)
- React Navigation 7.x
- TypeScript
- React Native vector icons (@expo/vector-icons)

# Code Style

- Use StyleSheet for styling
- Use React Native's built-in components
- Match Android Compose colors exactly
